    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d159">

                <pb facs="0362" n="242" xml:id="pg242"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4/1196: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Acting Chairman of the American Delegation (Gibson)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-06-28T13:00:00-04:00">June 28, 1932—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>154. Your 281. I think a short visit by Mr. Kellogg to Geneva might prove extremely useful and count on you
                    to post him as to the situation in respect to the Conference.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
